    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 🧠 Extract FAQ's from HelpDesk Tickets\n\nThis workflow reviews incoming helpdesk tickets to identify common questions and produce concise question-and-answer pairs for the knowledgebase. It automates extraction, validation, and formatting of FAQs for publication.\n\n## 🔔 Trigger\n New or updated helpdesk tickets flagged for knowledgebase review.\n\n## 🧩 Steps\n* Scan selected tickets and extract candidate Q&A pairs\n* Validate and deduplicate entries against existing KB\n* Format and insert approved FAQs into the knowledgebase\n\n## 🎯 Outcome\n A curated set of validated FAQs added to the knowledgebase, improving self-service and reducing repeat tickets.\n\n### 📝 Note: Ensure sensitive or PII-containing content is redacted before publication.",
        "height": 1008,
        "width": 832,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1808,
        800
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "b09d34e0-4c98-4f2c-91e6-fc2eb71ae0ea",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "helpdesk",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "75dcc732-ff78-4abc-98d0-3c23f318a92d",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
